python manage.py build_cueceramica
python manage.py runserver 8000

your_django_project/
├── manage.py
├── config/                     # Main project folder (settings.py, root urls.py)
│   ├── settings.py
│   └── urls.py
└── cueceramica/                # Your app folder
    ├── __init__.py
    ├── serializers.py          # 1. DRF Serializers (ProductBodySerializer)
    ├── utils.py                # 2. HTML cleaning & description extraction
    ├── translator.py           # 3. Parallel Google Translate & cache logic
    ├── services.py             # 4. Squarespace fetcher, category map & RAM cache
    ├── views.py                # 5. APIView (CueCeramicaProductsAPIView)
    ├── urls.py                 # 6. App URL routing
    └── management/
        └── commands/
            └── build_cueceramica.py  # 7. CLI command: python manage.py build_cueceramica





[Squarespace Website]
       │
       ▼
1. utils.py           ➔ Cleans messy HTML into plain Spanish text
       │
       ▼
2. translator.py      ➔ Translates Spanish text into French & English
       │
       ▼
3. services.py        ➔ Builds the `product_body` dictionary & saves to Cache
       │
       ▼
4. serializers.py     ➔ Checks that the data types are 100% valid
       │
       ▼
5. views.py           ➔ Sends the JSON response to the user's browser

